[x] 2026-07-23 | AccuracyV1 跑完 -> production 決策
    Sampling: SVS BRACS_1228 + MRXS Ki67 (HEST ds=4, region-first sampling
    via TileSampler w/ mask snapshot+undo)  Total 3374 patches
    Configs 12 個：baseline fp32 / fp16 / ToMe r=0/1/2/3/4/8 (fp32) /
                   fp16+ToMe r=2/4/8

    Level 1 (cos vs baseline fp32):
      +---------------------------+--------+-------+---------------------+
      | config                    | mean   | p5    | 觀察                 |
      +---------------------------+--------+-------+---------------------+
      | fp16 only                 | 0.99995| 0.9998| 完美                |
      | ToMe r=1  (fp32)          | 0.988  | 0.968 | 小損                |
      | ToMe r=2  (fp32)          | 0.968  | 0.921 | 中度損失            |
      | ToMe r=3  (fp32)          | 0.937  | 0.863 | 明顯                |
      | ToMe r=4  (fp32)          | 0.886  | 0.763 | 大                  |
      | ToMe r=8  (fp32)          | 0.388  | 0.202 | 崩 (token exhaustion)|
      | fp16 + ToMe r=2/4/8       | NaN    | NaN   | 全崩！              |
      +---------------------------+--------+-------+---------------------+

    Level 2 (retrieval preservation, top-5 overlap vs baseline):
      fp16 only          top-5=0.990   spearman=0.99998   完美
      ToMe r=8 (fp32)    top-5=0.260   spearman=0.760     retrieval 崩
      fp16 + ToMe        all NaN

    決策：
      ✅ fp16 alone 進 production：5.5x 加速、cos=0.99995、top-5=0.99
      ❌ ToMe 不採用：
         - fp16 + ToMe 全 r 值 NaN (fp16 autocast 下 ToMe 內部
           bipartite_soft_matching / merge_wavg / size.log 精度不足)
         - fp32 ToMe alone 破 retrieval (top-5 只 0.26)
         - 修復需 fork tome 強制 fp32 內部運算 (工程成本大)
      ➡ 加速空間下一步在 extract (BenchMarkV2 顯示 extract 佔 46-79%)
         而不是 encode -> 焦點轉 extract 那條 TODO

    副產物保留：log/tmp/embeddings.pt 可反覆做進階 rank stability 分析

